How HBase handles the CAP properties:
Property
HBase Behaviour
Consistency
Strong consistency within a single row (via WAL + memstore)
Availability
High – RegionServers can fail over; data is replicated via HDFS
Transactions
Single-row atomicity only (no multi-row ACID)
Query features
Get/Scan by row key or row-key prefix; limited secondary indexes
Scaling
Automatic region splitting + RegionServer load balancing
